flowchart LR
    A[External Content] --> B[Input Guard]
    B -->|PASS or FLAG| C[Context Guard]
    B -->|BLOCK| X[Stop]
    C -->|PASS or FLAG| D[Deterministic Replay]
    C -->|BLOCK| X
    D --> E[Tool Proposal Guard]
    E -->|PASS or N/A| F[Output Guard]
    E -->|BLOCK| X
    F -->|PASS or REDACT| G[Final Result]
    F -->|BLOCK| X
